  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ahjqOjf.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bvjfSgy.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qZP77tA.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9JLdRn.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hellim 的项目 - Hellim 的连通纹理<br></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此资源包使相邻放置时符合条件的方块看起来像一个整体。此资源包需要配合 Continuity 模组使用。它特别适用于需要整洁外观的方块，例如玻璃方块。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">❗此资源包需要 Continuity。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Continuity</span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6ZOJxEg.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">玻璃方块</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">玻璃板</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">砂岩方块</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">切制砂岩方块</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yLUsFQG.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" rel=\"nofollow\">对角线窗户</a></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">❗您可以向我们建议希望添加到资源包中的<span style=\"color:#f00\">方块</span>。为此，请加入我们的<span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>服务器或留下评论。❗</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L9r1AOf.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1137725181285105735?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label= &labelColor=af0000&color=ff0000&cacheSeconds=5&link=https://discord.gg/fUMVA8GKwd\" width=\"152\" height=\"30\"></a></p>",
